# opentubex
===
OpenTubeX is an open-source, privacy-focused YouTube client. Watch videos without ads or a Google account, with subscriptions, playlists and history stored on your device by default.

- Organize subscriptions into profiles and choose which videos, Shorts, live streams and posts appear in your feed.
- Browse in tabs, build a playback queue and keep watching with the mini-player.
- Skip sponsored segments with SponsorBlock and replace clickbait titles and thumbnails with DeArrow.
- Customize themes, keyboard shortcuts, your Home page and playback preferences for each channel.
- Search your watch history and see your viewing time in daily and weekly charts.
- Optionally sync your library across devices, with end-to-end encryption available on compatible sync servers.
===
